{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_siege_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_siege_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "幻日",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_siege_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "afa01260bfe0342a5a01485f6b60c350669e248ed35817281f57716beec3df05",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "清理完这些外围的废弃地块，典范军就能抵达伦蒂尼姆的城墙下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "自从我们突破银石崖隘口之后，正面战场上食腐者的军队已经退却。我们原以为这些废弃地块里还是可能会有萨卡兹的埋伏......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是现在看来......空无一人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天空那种古怪的红色也开始消散了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我现在还有点后怕，这几天的战斗，简直和做梦一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这片战场上的人们用性命争取来了这场胜利，哪怕艰难，哪怕困苦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但，这确实是属于我们每一个人的胜利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们的家，已经近在咫尺了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "加快行动速度吧，尽快和......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "突然，巨大的轰鸣声响起，整个房屋剧烈地摇晃起来。\n少数几扇还算完整的窗户尽皆碎裂，诡异的尖啸从建筑物的深处传来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就说不会那么简单！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其他小队，向我们靠拢——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......那尖啸是，喷气声？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维娜，不会是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "通知其他小队撤出这座建筑物，战备等级提到最高，寻找掩体，注意防空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "本小队按照防御阵型继续前进，小心一切可能的袭击。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维娜，从诸王长眠之所出来以后，你们都说那位蒸汽骑士已经疯了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可在银石崖的战场上，他帮了我们对吧？所有人都说维多利亚的荣光回来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那他现在，到底是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "是啊，推进之王还能回忆起那个她被托举向上的瞬间，铠甲中传来的那声沉闷的怒吼。\n“荣光——维多利亚！！！”\n她分辨不出铠甲里的声音与她在诸王长眠之所中听到的是否有所不同。钢铁盔甲把一切从中发出的回声都铣成了相似的模样。\n有没有一种可能，如今在甲胄之下的，是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "推进之王摇了摇头，驱散了这些可笑的想法。\n那人选择直视自己命运的那份勇气，不应被任何一厢情愿的幻想所玷污。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等再见到他，我们就会有答案了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......他确实就在这里，起码曾经来过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "墙上与地面上遍布着火焰和刀刃留下的痕迹，巨大的疮疤延伸向建筑物的更深处。\n这些痕迹她已经不是第一次见，诸王长眠之所的那扇大门前，立着先王雕像的甬道上......\n在维多利亚人的颂歌中，蒸汽骑士的剑刃上喷吐出的是不屈的意志。\n如今呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里有萨卡兹的尸体，不止一具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萨卡兹们似乎想把最后的蒸汽骑士在这里围杀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "推进之王悚然而惊，这些话她曾听过。\n一只手扯了扯她的袖子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......推进之王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "达格达看着她，在诸王长眠之所的地下，她们曾一起经历过相同的场景。\n荣光的坟场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他是最后的蒸汽骑士了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果他仍像在伦蒂尼姆时一样与我们为敌，挡在我们的身前......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，没什么。我清楚的，我们迟早需要面对他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......达格达。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他有他的使命，而我们也有我们的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我们就扯下所有的“使命”，然后救下他。就这么简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们......有这个权利吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "与其犹犹豫豫，不如做完了再想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "推进之王胡乱揉了一把矮个子黑发女孩的头发，随即率先迈入了房间之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到处都是焦黑的尸体，还有——这些是蒸汽骑士的盔甲残片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这不是场像样的伏击，更像是场遭遇战，萨卡兹们也没想到会在这里遇到这么难缠的敌人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都检查过了，这里没有还有气的萨卡兹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只剩下里面的最后一片空间了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "断壁之后，房间的另一半隐藏在浓重的黑暗里。\n没有任何声音，没有任何气息，不久前的喷气声如同一个幻觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们留在这里，随时准备后撤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "推进之王慢慢接近着房间深处的黑暗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "也许，那些蒸汽与白烟会猛然再度迸射而出。\n也许，火焰组成的长剑会倏然亮起，照亮她的脸。\n也许，推进之王不禁去想，也许，最好的情况是——\n本以为就此失去的友人正倚着巨大的蒸汽甲胄，睡得正香。\n......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么样，维娜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......什么都没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蒸汽骑士已经离开了。我们刚刚听到的喷气声和崩塌声，大概就是他撞开墙壁离去的声音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他恐怕已经回到了伦蒂尼姆城里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "通知外围的部队，警报解除，十分钟后继续前进。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好的，我去联络。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "大家都松了一口气。\n推进之王却只是叹了一口气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维娜小姐，你......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "推进之王没有向众人提起她刚刚的发现。\n那什么都证明不了。\n或者说，一切早已得到证明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "典范军已经在预定时间抵达预定位置，伦蒂尼姆的城墙已经在目视距离以内。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "接下来，我们会继续向东北方向前进，在抵达外围地块之前不会停下，请各车辆确认坐标——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "邪异的红色散去后，日落正美。推进之王却有些心不在焉。\n这抹金色的余晖让她想到了老师那漂亮的鬃毛，和自己手中浸透无数传奇的长剑......\n以及——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维娜小姐，你在看什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，没什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "推进之王有些慌张地握紧了拳，却又自嘲地笑了笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......真不像我，对吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她犹豫了几秒钟，还是摊开了手掌。\n一块红色的，边缘带着烧灼痕迹的碎布正躺在她的手中。\n这些日子，风总是很猛烈，碎布翻动着，戴菲恩慌忙想要按住即将被风吹走的残片，推进之王却松开了手，任其飘飞，直至不见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在那个废弃地块里发现的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说不定只是块随处可见的衣服残片。说不定根本不是蒸汽骑士带来的，它本来就在那里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（红色的衣服......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怀疑阿勒黛·坎伯兰仍然活着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我希望许多人最终生还。但这就像我希望自己还是个诺伯特区的街头混混，希望这一切都没有发生一样，这种愿望什么意义都没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我听自救军的成员们提起过，阿勒黛·坎伯兰以前是他们的领袖，在取得诸王之息的任务中，坎伯兰女士没能回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......她为我们而牺牲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但并非真的如此，对吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道我从前的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在伦蒂尼姆的时候，我最需要收集的情报，除了萨卡兹的动向，自然就是那些和我一样的人，“钉子”与“暗桩”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "坎伯兰公爵的爵位已经不复存在，他的继承人却仍能在伦蒂尼姆公开活动。我们都知道这意味着什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维娜小姐，我无意影响你对她的印象，但维多利亚的大人物之间从没有无来由的善意与支持，我不得不说——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她接近我是有目的的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道，我们在......最后，很坦诚地谈了一次。她为开斯特效力，目的是帮助开斯特夺取诸王之息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而在这一切之后，你依然希望她活着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......依然愿意称她为朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这是种很危险的滥情，维娜小姐。军队需要纪律才能维系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道，戴菲恩。我与她都清楚，这是不可弥补，也不可饶恕的罪过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我仍会懊悔我的力量不够，以至于没能救下她......没能救下许多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我并没有和坎伯兰女士直接打过交道，在伦蒂尼姆也只是远远地看过她几眼。坎伯兰女士努力把自己的体面维护得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而她为此所付出的代价......也并不难想象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说这话也许会显得我缺乏同情心，但坎伯兰女士这样的人我见过很多。在这个国家，这确实就是游戏的规则。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她是舞台上的人，而舞台上的人别无选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可能可以抽身而出，因为......我遇到了你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正因为有你们，我才有机会选择不被那些肮脏的惯性驱使，不在大人物们的冷餐会中充当那个注定可悲的配角。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但当时的坎伯兰女士孤立无援。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿勒黛......我总是在想，她挺起胸膛直面了命运，她不是个选择了屈服的失败者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但，戴菲恩，总是把这些悲剧归咎于残酷的命运，是不是也是一种懒惰呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我习以为常的懒惰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......许多事并不是通过努力就能做到的，维娜小姐。我们之所以会用“命运”来形容那些庞大而无形的东西，正因为它不可违抗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵，就像你说的，“肮脏的惯性”，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而违反默契的那些人，会被轻柔而果决地杀死，就像蒸汽骑士们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像......阿利斯泰尔，我的父亲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维娜小姐——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心，我没打算为他鸣不平。说实话，我对他并不熟悉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说来好笑。在我很小的时候，我的养父母总是不厌其烦地和我说我父亲“阿利斯泰尔陛下”的事情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可他们去世得太早，我几乎都快忘了那些故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "直到阿勒黛重新向我提起这位皇帝，那些零星的记忆才回来一些。莽撞，雄心勃勃，一心想干出一番大事业——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，我不确定除了所谓血缘上的联系，我和他到底还有什么相似之处。他是个因改革失败被吊死的君主，得罪了几乎所有大贵族。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而我呢，我是个诺伯特区的混混，最熟悉的地方除了酒吧和拳馆，就是警察局了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我和他，我们确实都姓“维多利亚”，却也仅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......温德米尔公爵一直以来的职责是守卫维多利亚和莱塔尼亚的边界，我们对伦蒂尼姆发生的政治斗争并不那么关心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但......我的母亲确实很少向我说起那场政变，和阿利斯泰尔陛下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "简直像是有意回避。我自己曾经根据当时的情况分析过——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她做不了什么，我知道。不必对我有什么愧疚，戴菲恩，这就是维多利亚的游戏规则，在风平浪静中，一切早已被做好决定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "无论我母亲当时的想法如何，我觉得，有错的并不是想要改变什么的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们也想要改变，不是吗？只是......没人能知道该从什么做起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，无论是当年还是现在，每一个人都知道有什么地方出了问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这场战争确实在重塑维多利亚，但正在向什么方向重塑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你，我，我们队伍里这些人希望的那个未来......我们真的在走近它吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们刚刚目睹了威灵顿的改旗易帜，我们看见了大公爵们的踌躇不前，一如之前发生的所有事一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "戴菲恩，你觉得今天我们所面对的这一切，我们的国家经历的这一切......到底为什么发生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你真的要听我的意见？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可以简单地说，因为萨卡兹们狡猾而凶残，他们蒙蔽了我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维多利亚只是还需要时间。我能轻易得出和每个坐在庄园里看报纸的贵族一模一样的结论。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但，我们已经亲眼看过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个“遍洒荣光的祖国”，它短视、傲慢、轻率，充斥着贪蠹的贵族、昏庸的官僚、懦弱的议会、只顾着盘剥的土地主和工厂主......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "问题是，维娜，也许哪怕是人们眼中最辉煌的那个时代，维多利亚也是这个样子的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——这一切就是维多利亚曾经荣光的源头，但也是我们唾骂的那个惯性本身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我们现在有了一支队伍，也许是时候该做得更多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在说什么......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵，我突然明白了，我和我父亲原来还有一个相似之处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们的敌人，都是——“维多利亚”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也许他太莽撞，也许我比他好不了多少，也许我们的结局......最后也会是一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但值得尝试，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维娜——不，亚历山德莉娜·维娜·维多利亚，你知道自己在说什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们现在确实有了些伙伴，典范军在这场战争中创造了一个奇迹......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但——现在的这一切，都还仅限于伦蒂尼姆一座城市的周围！而整个维多利亚有多少座城市？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "参与这场战争的士兵和军官们把你视作英雄，是因为大公爵们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大公爵们需要一个英雄来掩盖自己的失败，我，我们，都不过是他们推举出的符号而已。我很清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那又如何。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们已经在这里了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这些推动着维多利亚的“惯性”，这些对荣光的迷恋、对辉煌的崇拜，这些帝王、公爵、大大小小的贵族、沦为傀儡的议会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "该到此为止了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你想改变这些，这全部？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不仅仅是改变。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要，与他们战斗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这当然并不简单，也许要对抗的将是组成这个国家的一切，是我们自己。也许这个过程需要很久，需要十年、二十年......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但如果我想让今天在伦蒂尼姆发生的这一切不会再发生，那么，这就是唯一的选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打败那个过去的维多利亚，直到读秒完毕，直到能站在擂台上的只有一个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那很遥远，从理智上我甚至要说，几乎不可能实现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个国家从不缺少改革者乃至革命者，他们有的失败，有的胜利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但无一例外的是，他们所有的努力都消弭在了伦蒂尼姆的雾气里。而维多利亚一如往常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但......维娜，你会把这里当作擂台，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，不管面对的是什么，我能做的也就只有——“揍歪下巴”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "事先说好，我没打算和你一起上场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但......如果你挥出了漂亮的一拳，我会为你喝彩的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么，就先让伦蒂尼姆的市民们知道，典范军正与他们站在一起吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们......回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "推进之王的余光似乎瞥见了一个金色的身影一闪而过。\n养父曾经满怀期盼地告诉自己，她的这位老师正是维多利亚的象征。\n有他的辅佐与陪伴，她会引领这个国家，直到荣光之下不再有任何苦难。\n那么......老师如今在想些什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他的脚步总是那么快，他的出现总是那么不可捉摸。\n他那金色的鬃毛总是在最寒冷的时候，为自己遮风，为自己取暖。\n他的身上有太阳的气息。\n可他已经......好几年没有出现过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高文",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高文",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我的手发酸，棺材太大了，就算是有大人们帮忙，把它抬进墓园也是件辛苦的事。\n养父的墓地就在养母的旁边，他们共用一块墓碑。\n那些我还小的时候会来串门的叔叔阿姨今天都没有出现。他们大概都已经放弃了吧，毕竟已经过去了那么久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高文",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你学会了知识，学会了战斗，也学会了生存。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高文",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已经没有更多可以教你的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老师似乎轻轻叹了口气，他转过了身，金色的鬃毛凑近了我的脸。\n一如既往，阳光的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高文",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是，孩子，你不知道自己该归向何处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高文",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不知道你从我这里学到的东西，应作何用场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高文",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，从没有什么“使命”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高文",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "于你如此，于我相同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高文",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "被束缚者将锁链称为使命，仅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高文",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若你终将迈出脚步......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高文",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么，我亦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "稍等，有新的通讯——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "收到，请继续调查，必要时申请罗德岛的协助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "技术人员们刚刚报告，他们追踪到了一个一直在监听我们的信号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是公爵，还是萨卡兹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很奇怪，都不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "信号解析的结果是......我从没听说过这个名字......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "似乎，伦蒂尼姆城里的人，称呼她为“铣痕”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
